                            "Packed rectifier C-2 at Silicium-Staith SS-5 is already boiling SiCl4 14 C over the published 104 C kettle cap when a 2 kHz well TC sample races the steam-orifice publisher. Steam is still armed at 920 kg/h; a timely clamp to 480 kg/h keeps the kettle under cap. A packing collar already cracked on tray 7 still collapses inside the 42 ms raster after that process-correct steam clamp.",